10	 * Every SVE lane of the broadcast vector is checked byte-for-byte against
11	 * the libm single-rounding reference (fmaf/fma) — a per-lane SDC signature
12	 * in any lane is caught. Framework SNaN quieting applies uniformly so the
13	 * byte-exact compare stays sound. NaN results compare NaN-class-only:
14	 * IEEE-754 leaves NaN payload propagation implementation-defined (the
15	 * hardware svmla ORs input NaN payloads, libm fma forwards the first
16	 * operand's), so only NaN-ness is checked; all non-NaN results (incl.
17	 * -0.0 sign flips, the SDC signal) remain byte-exact.
18	 * @endparblock
19	 */
